# Windows PowerShell resolves its module analysis cache relative to the checkout
# when a redirected USERPROFILE makes the default path relative, which installer
# tests do deliberately. tests/installers/test_powershell_cache.py asserts the
# cache stays out of the working directory; ignore it too so a leaked file from a
# manual installer run cannot be committed.
/Microsoft/Windows/PowerShell/ModuleAnalysisCache
